{"id":1779,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>以篮会友，以赛聚力。5月22日下午，机械工程学院研究生“挑战杯”篮球赛正式开始，全院多个班级共六十余名同学踊跃报名参赛。赛事通过各班级抽签进行积分赛比拼，再以积分从高到低排序进行冠亚军与季军的争夺，旨在搭建跨年级、跨班级交流互动平台，丰富研究生课余文体生活，引导大家在深耕科研之余走出实验室、坚持体育锻炼，展现机械研究生朝气蓬勃、奋勇争先的青春风貌。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-nRLWbozn7Mm9YUHzrVM4r7MRG4nR9giLRrfUzL4MzNsM7C0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yYnSy4n1hRUm-PMzW7LmUPnRLPLzL4nlrRM8nfnR6RoRMFL8MVLmQ7L4TFLz6RLzCJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky4oRUZMYbw62L8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=38487&e=.jpeg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B2E3FCB2152D241D31133EEC7DAD7C83/3CE26D39/17C16\" vheight=\"307\" vwidth=\"409\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-nRLWbozn7Mm9YUHzrVM4r7MRG4nR9giLRrfUzL4MzNsM7C0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yYnSy4n1hRUm-PMzW7LmUPnRLPLzL4nlrRM8nfnR6RoRMFL8MVLmQ7L4TFLz6RLzCJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky4oRUZMYbw62L8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=38487&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>随着裁判一声哨响，篮球赛正式拉开帷幕。赛场上，球员们精神饱满、斗志昂扬，运球突破、精准传球、跳投得分、卡位防守轮番上演。篮球在空中划出优美轨迹，队员们步伐矫健、配合默契，每一次攻防转换都全力以赴、每一次拼抢都奋勇争先。赛场边呐喊声、助威声、欢呼声不绝于耳，热血氛围点燃整个球场，尽显青年学子的活力与担当。在历经各班级积分赛角逐与淘汰赛比拼下，最终研一一班凭借沉稳发挥与默契配合斩获冠军，研一三班、研二三班分别拿下亚军、季军，热烈的掌声与欢呼声久久萦绕赛场。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-Um6W7o7UZozA2LH4lYM8QknmUDMRNgDMllsL4UYLlL8LzC0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyDMYy8MSybUz9aMRvaozviLRvsMlnfMzTRL4LaU4vsn7WFU4QRMzCDL8WFLzffUmNJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky4oRUZMYbw62L8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=38487&e=.jpeg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/167459A804709750775DA59C330C77DB/C6C5663B/10AB9\" vheight=\"261\" vwidth=\"348\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-Um6W7o7UZozA2LH4lYM8QknmUDMRNgDMllsL4UYLlL8LzC0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyDMYy8MSybUz9aMRvaozviLRvsMlnfMzTRL4LaU4vsn7WFU4QRMzCDL8WFLzffUmNJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky4oRUZMYbw62L8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=38487&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>颁奖仪式由王佳敏委老师主持，她为获奖班级颁发荣誉证书及纪念奖品，并与全体参赛队员合影留念，将赛场拼搏瞬间与青春美好记忆定格珍藏。整场赛事氛围融洽、秩序井然，赛场内外洋溢着团结友爱、拼搏进取的浓厚氛围。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-UzWW7nm-iozlZnHmAkozfVnmLbMzng7Mz9bU4LaUz-DnmU0gihFp2hmCIa0LSybn1y8MSyZMRUbMNVfnNLaU4GDUmMVolQfMm6RLRUaMznFUN-bLmVkMNWFnlCYU1b/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LZMR9sgtA8pULcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=38487&e=.jpeg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/19F4584496AAFC0C06B3E9FA67C04054/BB921B6B/EF2B\" vheight=\"340\" vwidth=\"453\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-UzWW7nm-iozlZnHmAkozfVnmLbMzng7Mz9bU4LaUz-DnmU0gihFp2hmCIa0LSybn1y8MSyZMRUbMNVfnNLaU4GDUmMVolQfMm6RLRUaMznFUN-bLmVkMNWFnlCYU1b/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LZMR9sgtA8pULcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=38487&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>学院以此次篮球赛为契机，激励全体研究生将赛场上奋勇拼搏、团结协作的精神，融入日常科研学习与生活之中。以强健体魄筑牢成长根基，以拼搏姿态追逐学术梦想，以团队合力攻克科研难关，把赛场热血化为笃行奋进的动力，在求学成才与科研报国的道路上奋勇前行、逐梦不止。</p><p>文/史高贤</p><p>摄/史高贤</p><p>一审/王睿彬</p><p>二审/段妮杰</p><p>三审/王佳敏</p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-nRLWbozn7Mm9YUHzrVM4r7MRG4nR9giLRrfUzL4MzNsM7C0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yYnSy4n1hRUm-PMzW7LmUPnRLPLzL4nlrRM8nfnR6RoRMFL8MVLmQ7L4TFLz6RLzCJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky4oRUZMYbw62L8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=38487&e=.jpeg"}